{"reviewId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw", "review": {"abstract": "按照康德拉季耶夫所揭示的人类行为规律，未来20年就是要洗去过去30年繁荣中的过度需求成分，探索未来新的经济动力源，从而为下一次繁荣做好准备。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "这篇文章写于2010年，他预测，未来20年就是周期中的衰退和萧条期，那么也就是在2030年左右，这个长波才有可能走完，在这20年中必须要找到新的科技增长点，才能拉动经济的发展。比如19世纪的火车，后来修铁路，大炼钢铁，石油，轮船，计算机等等，这些都是当时适应时代的经济增长点，现在全球基本上还没有发现新的技术革命，目前所知道的就是ai，但是这个还没有完全落实到经济发展当中", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "1481-1551", "createTime": 1749474169, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "等老百姓完全落实的时候，说明这个行业已经渗透结束了。所以，现在的社会规律是通常风险是突然来的，而经济的变化是螺旋式变化的。", "reviewId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw", "commentId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw_c414635657_8bV8jfEn9", "userVid": 414635657, "createTime": 1788703832, "author": {"userVid": 414635657, "name": "大国", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-mRA3AdfMOI5PcWkDqas1a10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "事业、阅读、咖啡、茶", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}}, {"content": "经济发展的每次增长点都是“以人的需求”为根本点，火车、内燃机都是以解放了人的劳动力得到了人们实在的需求。个人认为以后的经济增长点，农业也会占比一定的比例，毕竟中国人也是吃了三十多年的农药、化肥、速成肉、科技与狠活等等了，好多新品种，水果没有水果味、蔬菜没有蔬菜味，肉只有添加剂的味。对于那些老品种、无公害的农产品的需求存在潜在空间。国家层面应该制定农产品无公害种植、养殖、包装、运输、销售、检测等的全流程标准，由相关部门负责监管，保证人们买到真正的无公害农产品。贵一点没关系，但不能假。", "reviewId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw", "commentId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw_c390687347_8adt4dhlz", "userVid": 390687347, "createTime": 1782702024, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 390687347, "name": "李晓鹏", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/3a3QxMHZ8YybUsJic6mdGKBibufTL2pIjRzTBJgibvFwKM7kdUrPQ0ib1Q/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "李晓鹏", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}}, {"content": "现在就有啊，就是贵", "reviewId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw", "toCommentId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw_c390687347_8adt4dhlz", "toUserVid": 390687347, "commentId": "380402079_80MtnkgNw_c205268425_8aqfmZlFu", "userVid": 205268425, "createTime": 1783427878, "author": {"userVid": 205268425, "name": "零。", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ajNVdqHZLLD2TOcibqyTO3mwVxlFnFic5libiavahvH1tn1mqt6LeNF1NN4IH7oBIBoKwPl2FfU0xOUD